{"id": 97, "name": "Benedetta", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_11bf645722b931631c3a63d5be7da068.png", "cls": ["Assassin", "Fighter"], "specialty": ["Chase", "Burst"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["60", "50", "20", "70"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Female warrior defending the Barren Lands against demon invasion.", "skills": [{"name": "Elapsed Daytime", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dec94d48625abe29337a7dc247ae4089.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Hold the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Basic Attack</span> button to enter the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Swordout</span> state and charge Sword Intent. Once fully charged, release it to perform a Swordout Slash in <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">the direction she's facing</span> and dash forward, dealing <span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+215% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies on the path (counts as skill damage and is reduced to 50% against minions and creeps).\n\nBenedetta can only cast Swordout Slash when her Sword Intent is full and she is in the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Swordout</span> state.\n\nBenedetta also gains Sword Intent by dealing damage with her Basic Attacks and skills."}, {"name": "Phantom Slash", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ae06e5db054c1b94fcc70b2158828fc6.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10   Mana Cost: 55", "desc": "Benedetta withdraws swiftly and leaves a shadow in front. After a short delay, her shadow slashes forward in a fan-shaped area, dealing 200<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+75% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical 